<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 60, left: 60, width: '1160px', height: '64px', background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>研究背景与问题</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F5' }}>01 · Background</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 148, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        应届生在求职中普遍缺乏可反复练习、且能拿到具体反馈的面试机会——这构成了本课题要回答的核心问题。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: '370px', padding: '20px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '30px', height: '30px', background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Ⅰ</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>练不了</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          真实面试机会稀缺且不可重复，一次失误即失去机会，无法通过「多练」形成能力提升。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: '370px', padding: '20px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '30px', height: '30px', background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Ⅱ</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>不知道错哪</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          即便参加了真实面试，也几乎拿不到逐题的、可操作的改进建议，同类错误被反复带到下一场。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: '370px', padding: '20px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: '30px', height: '30px', background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Ⅲ</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>工具不像面试</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          现有产品以选择题与背诵八股为主，缺少「开口说—被追问—被评价」的闭环；云端 AI 面试在国内常因语音服务不可用而失效。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 20px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>本研究的切入点：</span>
        现有方案集中在「题目与答案」，对「开口表达 + 可操作反馈」关注不足。本项目以全语音交互重建面试现场，并把面试官的决策过程显式化。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>面镜 MockMirror · AI 模拟面试与能力提升软件</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>03 / 20</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
